{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#991","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#991","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#991\",\"parent_revision\":\"0da9e775306013941cb49b9780b73de839853e6936b85472c23542fcdf1b03f1\",\"root_revision\":\"0da9e775306013941cb49b9780b73de839853e6936b85472c23542fcdf1b03f1\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe python3-development:code-reviewer agent has tools: mcp__plugin_dh_sam__sam_create in its frontmatter (line 4 of plugins/python3-development/agents/code-reviewer.md). This restricts it to only the sam_create MCP tool \u2014 no Read, Bash, Glob, Grep, or any file access tools.\\n\\nA code reviewer needs file system access to review code. The agent was blocked twice during /complete-implementation quality gates (sessions 2026-03-21 and 2026-03-22), requiring fallback to general-purpose agent each time.\\n\\nFix: either remove the tools restriction entirely (inherit all tools) or set tools to an appropriate read-only set (Read, Grep, Glob, Bash).\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **code-reviewer agent has tools restricted to sam_create only \u2014 cannot read files** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session 2026-03-22: code-reviewer agent blocked twice during complete-implementation quality gates\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-22\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"aff9f8667f1485eb436a8d4e9ee394f7afe1278b5224a23df2743014c7e63656\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVWXnRA\"}"}